=== busy-help (80x24) ===
sei | Help
r refresh \u00b7 ? help \u00b7 Esc close/cancel \u00b7 q/Ctrl+C quit
Unconfigured slots do nothing. g has no timeout; invalid keys cancel it.

COPY AND REMOVE
Use these keys from the library to copy a skill:
a: Claude Code / Project; A: Claude Code / Global
b: Codex / Project; B: Codex / Global
c: OpenCode / Project; C: OpenCode / Global

ERRORS AND BEHAVIOR
Copy always replaces the entire destination, including local edits.
x permanently removes a destination skill. No confirmation or undo.
No trash, backup, or rollback. Failures may leave missing or partial output.
Retry copy or remove the partial skill after inspecting the destination.
While working: navigation stays available; refresh and quit wait.
Additional copy/remove keys are ignored during work. Paste is ignored.
Other agents may also load skills from these folders. sei shows configured
folder contents, not everything an agent discovers or has loaded.
Result: Add \\\"look-safe\\\\x1b[2J\\\\r\\\\nspoof\\\" to Claude Code / Project (/project/
long-path/long-path/long-path/long-path/long-path/long-path/long-path/long-path/
): working
Help 11/31 | up/down scroll | ?/Esc close |
Working; q waits for completion | g pending: 1-9 global, Esc cancel

